{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Experience Fantasy Trader, a passion project crafted over three years by a dedicated indie developer. The game is still in production, so the final product may feature a different UI layout, graphics, and game elements than those currently shown in screenshots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Guide your trading post to riches and fame in a dynamic fantasy world. Build relationships with visiting heroes and address their unique needs and challenges. Defend what\u2019s yours from monsters, thieves, and tax collectors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the owner of a trading post, you can pursue many paths toward wealth, fame, bankruptcy, or even death:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop and leverage 17 different skills, including trade connections, negotiation, leadership, architectural vision, and more. Construct and upgrade over 30 distinct structures to expand your post.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own trading style by sourcing over 300 types of goods from local markets and stocking them in your stores. Capitalize on price fluctuations and a dynamic event system that impacts prices through factors like new taxes, guild and royal politics, wars, and monster invasions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in negotiations with visitors and clients. Want to keep a customer\u2019s interest? Offer them a job? Or perhaps you\u2019d rather share a drink, play a game of dice, or simply chat?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are the local markets lacking interesting goods, or are prices just too high? Try crafting your own products from semi-finished goods\u2014or take your chances on the black market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consider hiring mercenaries: save on wages by making vague promises, or build a loyal, well-paid team of soldiers. You could even consider overthrowing the king\u2014after all, who enjoys paying taxes? But be prepared for the consequences\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be an honest merchant or a profit-at-all-costs dealer? Earn a reputation as a trustworthy trader or become known for shady, underhanded dealings. Build the most beautiful trading post in the kingdom, or a fortified fortress adorned with war trophies to deter intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the world of Fantasy Trader and discover your path.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3037460?t=1745137270","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745137270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745137270","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745137270","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Experience Fantasy Trader, a passion project crafted over three years by a dedicated indie developer. The game is still in production, so the final product may feature a different UI layout, graphics, and game elements than those currently shown in screenshots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Guide your trading post to riches and fame in a dynamic fantasy world. Build relationships with visiting heroes and address their unique needs and challenges. Defend what\u2019s yours from monsters, thieves, and tax collectors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the owner of a trading post, you can pursue many paths toward wealth, fame, bankruptcy, or even death:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop and leverage 17 different skills, including trade connections, negotiation, leadership, architectural vision, and more. Construct and upgrade over 30 distinct structures to expand your post.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own trading style by sourcing over 300 types of goods from local markets and stocking them in your stores. Capitalize on price fluctuations and a dynamic event system that impacts prices through factors like new taxes, guild and royal politics, wars, and monster invasions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in negotiations with visitors and clients. Want to keep a customer\u2019s interest? Offer them a job? Or perhaps you\u2019d rather share a drink, play a game of dice, or simply chat?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are the local markets lacking interesting goods, or are prices just too high? Try crafting your own products from semi-finished goods\u2014or take your chances on the black market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consider hiring mercenaries: save on wages by making vague promises, or build a loyal, well-paid team of soldiers. You could even consider overthrowing the king\u2014after all, who enjoys paying taxes? But be prepared for the consequences\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be an honest merchant or a profit-at-all-costs dealer? Earn a reputation as a trustworthy trader or become known for shady, underhanded dealings. Build the most beautiful trading post in the kingdom, or a fortified fortress adorned with war trophies to deter intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the world of Fantasy Trader and discover your path.</p>","developers":["TarVoy"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037460/header.jpg?t=1745137270","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 TarVoyCreative. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nThis game uses Unity Engine by Unity Technologies. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118139,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118139/movie480.mp4?t=1742846305","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118139/movie_max.mp4?t=1742846305"},"name":"Fantasy Trader - trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118139/46e565cef583857ecf685c6f5c075e6c0b0e556c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742846305","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118139/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742846305","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118139/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742846305"}}],"name":"Fantasy Trader","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Fantasy Trader - $2.99 USD","packageid":1079827,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":299}],"title":"Buy Fantasy Trader"}],"packages":[1079827],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Pentium\u00ae IV 2.4 GHz or AMD 3500+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce 8800 or ATI Radeon\u00ae X1900, 512mb graphics memory required.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2024 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","